# The Vault - James Burchill

The Vault is the collection of writing by James Burchill, founder of Driftinel, systems architect, CTO and bestselling author.

The library shares practical knowledge, essays, field notes, and resources across business, technology, AI, systems architecture, publishing, and teaching. Because Drift Happens is the drift and governance framework that informs James’s systems work. Driftinel is an independent managed service in development to help business owners keep their promises and catch problems early. James also serves as CTO at Tooljar and Principal & Systems Architect at JMG. Governing intelligent systems remains a deeper technical theme within this broader collection.

